<span id="S8.T5.2.1.5.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="S8.T5.2.1.5.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S8.T5.2.1.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:80%;">Dominant failure mode</span></span>
