Ancker, J. S., Edwards, A., Nosal, S., Hauser, D., Mauer, E., &amp; Kaushal, R. (2017). Effects of workload, work complexity, and repeated alerts on alert fatigue in a clinical decision support system. </span><span id="bib.bib3.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;">BMC Medical Informatics and Decision Making</span><span id="bib.bib3.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">, 17(36).
</span>
